        <t:body>
            <t:div type="bibliography">
                
                <t:listBibl type="editions">
                    <t:bibl corresp="http://zotero.org/groups/358366/items/BL5NWGBV"><seg type="webpage"><!-- attributes from original bibl--></seg><ptr target="bm:MgWebsite"/><title level="a">መልክአ፡ ጉባኤ፡ Malkǝʾa gubāʾe</title><author><forename>Augustine</forename><surname>Dickinson</surname></author><date>2020</date><note type="accessed">2024-09-24</note><note type="url">https://malkeagubae.com/</note><note type="tags"><note type="tag">bm:MgWebsite</note></note><note type="tag">bm:MgWebsite</note></t:bibl>
                </t:listBibl>            
            </t:div>
                
        <t:div type="edition" xml:id="div2LIT4551Salam">
            <t:div type="textpart" subtype="incipit" xml:lang="gez">
                <t:note>The following incipit follows <t:ref type="mss" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/BDLaethe4">Oxford, Bodleian Library, Bodleian Aeth. e. 4</t:ref>.</t:note>
                <t:ab>
                    አዚዝ፡ ላሊበላ፡ ዓለመ፡ ዘትቀኒ።
                    ሰላም፡ ለዝክረ፡ ስምከ፡ ከመ፡ ቃለ፡ ማዕነቅ፡ ድምፅ።
                </t:ab>
            </t:div>
        </t:div>
            <t:div type="edition" xml:lang="gez" xml:id="div3LIT4551Salam"><t:note>After <t:bibl corresp="http://zotero.org/groups/358366/items/BL5NWGBV"><seg type="webpage"><!-- attributes from original bibl--></seg><ptr target="bm:MgWebsite"/><title level="a">መልክአ፡ ጉባኤ፡ Malkǝʾa gubāʾe</title><author><forename>Augustine</forename><surname>Dickinson</surname></author><date>2020</date><note type="accessed">2024-09-24</note><note type="url">https://malkeagubae.com/</note><note type="tags"><note type="tag">bm:MgWebsite</note></note><note type="tag">bm:MgWebsite</note></t:bibl></t:note>
                <t:div type="textpart" xml:id="malke">
                    <t:lg type="stanza" n="1">
                        <t:l n="1">እስመ፡ ብዙኃን፡ አኃው፡ እለ፡ እሙንቲ፡ ቀደሙኒ፨</t:l>
                        <t:l n="2">አኀዙ፡ ይንግሩ፡ ዝክረ፡ ስምከ፡ ዝስይሤኒ፨</t:l>
                        <t:l n="3">አነኒ፡ ማሕሌተ፡ መልክእከ፡ ይእዜኒ፨</t:l>
                        <t:l n="4">ከመ፡ እጽሐፍ፡ በበ፡ ምትልው፡ ሊተኒ፡ ረትአኒ፨</t:l>
                        <t:l n="5">ዐዚዝ፡ ላሊበላ፡ ዓለመ፡ ዘትቀኒ፨</t:l>
                    </t:lg>
                    <t:lg type="stanza" n="2">
                        <t:l n="1">ሰላም፡ ለዝክረ፡ ስምከ፡ ከመ፡ ቃለ፡ ማዕነቅ፡ ድሙጽ፨</t:l>
                        <t:l n="2">በአህጉር፡ ወዓፅ፨</t:l>
                        <t:l n="3">ላሊበላ፡ ፍቅርከ፡ ውስተ፡ ልብየ፡ ሕኑጽ፨</t:l>
                        <t:l n="4">ይሱቀኒ፡ አድኅኖትከ፡ እምነ፡ ትንታኔ፡ ወዳኀፅ፨</t:l>
                        <t:l n="5">ወይሂጶ፡ ለፀርየ፡ ጸሎትከ፡ ሐጽ፨</t:l>
                    </t:lg>
                    <t:lg type="stanza" n="45">
                        <t:l n="1">ሰላም፡ ለመቃብሪከ፡ በዐጸደ፡ ቅድስት፡ ጎልጎታ፨</t:l>
                        <t:l n="2">ለመቃብረ፡ ክርስቶስ፡ ካልእታ፨</t:l>
                        <t:l n="3">ላሊበላ፡ በለዝ፡ ለጥበብ፡ ዐምደ፡ ቤታ፨</t:l>
                        <t:l n="4">እሞተ፡ ጌጋይ፡ ከመ፡ ትትነሣእ፡ ሕያውታ፨</t:l>
                        <t:l n="5">ለነፍስየ፡ በላ፡ ተንሥኢ፡ ጣቢታ፨</t:l>
                    </t:lg>
                    <t:lg type="stanza" n="46">
                        <t:l n="1">እምትራፈ፡ ገድልከ፡ ንስቲተ፡ ፍተ፡ ጻማከ፡ እዜኑ፨</t:l>
                        <t:l n="2">ውዱሰ፡ ምግባር፡ ላሊበላ፡ ለእግዚአብሔር፡ ዐርከ፡ ምእመኑ፨</t:l>
                        <t:l n="3">በምጽዋት፡ ፈጸምከ፡ ንዋየ፡ ለእግርከ፡ እስከ፡ አሣዕኑ፨</t:l>
                        <t:l n="4">እንዘ፡ ንጉሥ፡ በሥልጣኑ፡ ወመስፍን፡ በምኵናኑ፨</t:l>
                        <t:l n="5">ዘኢያትረፈ፡ ልብሰ፡ ለበድኑ፡ ከማከ፡ መኑ፨</t:l>
                    </t:lg>
                </t:div>
            </t:div>
        </t:body>
